<%#
  Renders nothing. A layout or page that renders studio/leveling_activity_assets
  keeps working; the render can be deleted.

  The leveling-activity modals' behaviour is the studio/leveling_activity module
  (its header carries the opts and the JSON contract). studio/alpine_shims
  publishes its factory as window.levelingActionModal on every page, before
  Alpine starts, so x-data="levelingActionModal({...})" on
  studio/modals/blocks/_leveling_activity and _change_username resolves with no
  page-level script.
%>
